---
// A quebra: fundo claro depois de várias seções escuras. A tipografia vira arquitetura.
---

<section class="statement theme-light" id="statement" data-header="light" data-chapter="Declaração" data-statement aria-labelledby="statement-title">
  <p class="statement__label wrap t-mono"><span class="idx"><span>06</span><span>Declaração</span></span></p>
  <h2 id="statement-title" class="sr-only">O espaço deve sobreviver à moda.</h2>

  <div class="statement__lines" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="st" data-st data-dir="1">O espaço</span>
    <span class="st" data-st data-dir="-1">Deve</span>
    <span class="st" data-st data-dir="1">Sobreviver</span>
    <span class="st" data-st data-dir="-1"><span class="st__ghost" data-st-trend>À moda.</span></span>
  </div>

  <p class="statement__foot wrap t-mono">Uma casa boa é desenhada para durar mais do que a moda que a inspirou.</p>
</section>

<style>
  .statement {
    position: relative;
    overflow: clip;
    padding-block: clamp(72px, 12vh, 140px) clamp(48px, 8vh, 96px);
  }
  .statement__label {
    color: rgb(12 12 11 / 0.6);
    margin-bottom: clamp(20px, 4vh, 48px);
  }
  .statement__lines {
    display: grid;
  }
  .st {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(4.6rem, 1rem + 20vw, 26rem);
    line-height: 0.76;
    letter-spacing: -0.075em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    white-space: nowrap;
    padding-left: var(--gutter);
    will-change: transform;
  }
  .st__ghost {
    color: transparent;
    -webkit-text-stroke: clamp(1px, 0.18vw, 3px) var(--paper-ink);
    display: inline-block;
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .st {
      font-size: 15.6vw;
    }
  }
  .statement__foot {
    margin-top: clamp(32px, 7vh, 80px);
    color: rgb(12 12 11 / 0.62);
    max-width: 60ch;
    text-transform: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
</style>
